  {
   "type": "product_header",
   "title": "»mµFocus«",
   "text": "<p>The analyst for the finest <br/>structures of a tool</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/en_DE/company/contact\">Request now</a></p>",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/c/8/csm_myFocus_header_de2cb108cf.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 1080,
    "h": 930
   },
   "ftype": "zoller_product_header",
   "id": "c1607",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {
    "before": "default",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> The essence of tool quality </h2>",
   "body": "<p>The competence of a tool manufacturer or grinding company is reflected in the rounding of a cutting edge and the evenness of the surface. »mµFocus« makes this high level of competence measurable.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/en_DE/company/contact\">Request now</a> <a href=\"https://myzoller.com/us/en/expert/booking/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">1:1 expert meeting</a></p>",
   "images": [],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "text",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c1815",
   "bg": "black",
   "space": {
    "before": "extra-large",
    "after": "extra-large"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "highlight",
   "items": [
    "Smallest measurable radius: 1.4 µm",
    "Simple operation, quick selection of geometries",
    "ISO-compliant for all measured variables"
   ],
   "header": "",
   "ftype": "zoller_highlight",
   "id": "c1816",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "hotspots",
   "header": "<h2> For the analysis of rounding, surface and profile roughness </h2>",
   "intro": "",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/4/csm_muefocus_infodots_01_a47dbb8091.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 1340,
    "h": 840
   },
   "spots": [
    {
     "x": 20.672,
     "y": 5.119,
     "label": "Comprehensive protection of components",
     "text": "<h3>Comprehensive protection of components</h3> <h4>Comprehensive protection of the components</h4> <p>»mμFocus« measurement technology and mechanics are safely protected against moisture, dirt and dust. This means a long service life and makes »mµFocus« ready for use directly in production. Special measuring rooms are not required.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 13.881,
     "y": 60.952,
     "label": "Fine adjustment",
     "text": "<h3>Fine adjustment</h3> <h4>Manual fine adjustment of the Z-axis</h4> <p>After manual pre-positioning, you can use the precise handwheel to bring the sensor to the correct height and thus place the focal plane precisely on the desired cutting area.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 24.403,
     "y": 44.405,
     "label": "Measuring sensor variants",
     "text": "<h3>Measuring sensor variants</h3> <h4>Measuring sensor variants</h4> <p>The blue symbol indicates the version with the »zep sensor«(ZOLLER Edge Preparation). This allows you to measure the cutting edge preparation with high precision. </p> <p>If this symbol is yellow, then the optional confocal microscope with the »zep-R sensor«(ZOLLER Edge Preparation Roughness) is installed. This sensor also analyzes the surface roughness.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 34.552,
     "y": 54.881,
     "label": "Tool holders",
     "text": "<h3>Tool holders</h3> <h4>Many tool holders available</h4> <p>With the numerous optional tool holders available, you can use »mµFocus« for a wide variety of tools - for example for tools with clamping sleeves or for indexable inserts.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 50.97,
     "y": 20.357,
     "label": "»Pilot 4.0« measurement software",
     "text": "<h3>»Pilot 4.0« measurement software</h3> <h4>»pilot 4.0« measurement software</h4> <p>The »pilot« device software offers you comprehensive convenience. Selection and input fields are clearly laid out, all functions support efficient working and you have many options for processing and displaying measured values.</p>"
    }
   ],
   "ftype": "zoller_image-hotspots",
   "id": "c1817",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {
    "before": "default",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> High-precision three-dimensional images </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">Using many individual images, »mµFocus« calculates highly precise 3D representations of the tool cutting edge. You determine the depth of detail via the number of images. The measurement result can be displayed topographically, in grayscale, as measurement curves or in tabular form according to DIN. The most perspective-rich view of tool cutting edges.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/1/csm_muefocus_c01_a66e9ca4dd.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1454
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c1819",
   "bg": "black",
   "space": {
    "before": "small",
    "after": "small"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Takes you to the finest textures </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">The ZOLLER »mμFocus« takes a systematic approach to microstructures. With clear workflows and supportive tools, you gain detailed insights into tool cutting edges and surfaces. You can quickly identify wear and tear, create a 3D model with just one click, and perform simple measurements of cutting edge preparation and surface roughness.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/9/d/csm_muefocus_c02_ad2464f4fa.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1454
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c1821",
   "bg": "black",
   "space": {
    "before": "none",
    "after": "none"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> »pilot 4.0«: Perfection with image data </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">»pilot 4.0« supports you perfectly. Simple operation, clear icons for cutting edge shapes and fast navigation through the menu structure characterize this device software. The integrated image processing calculates meaningful diagrams and 3D visualizations from image data. You will immediately recognize the unmistakable signature of your tool production.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/7/e/csm_muefocus_c03_01_a62358e657.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1454
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c1820",
   "bg": "black",
   "space": {
    "before": "small",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> The perfectionist for tool cutting </h2>",
   "body": "<p>»mµFocus« combines simple operation and a measuring accuracy of up to 0.1 µm. This device is the perfectionist for in-process inspection of cutting edge preparation and surface roughness.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/en_DE/company/contact\">Inquire now</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
